{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00648","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 雍和二章 一 · 张说","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 雍和二章 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"在涤嘉豢，丽碑敬牲。\n角握之牡，色纯之騂。\n火传阳燧，水溉阴精。\n太公胖俎，[傅]说和羹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}